window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Tristan Zimmerman. Zodiac Tactical code name: Pisces. </b><br> <br> Independent, wise, and intuitive—<i>still waters run deep. </i><br> <br> He's the leader of Zodiac Tactical’s guardian unit. They're the bodyguards—the ones who stand toe to toe with danger and refuse to give any ground. They protect people who need it most.<br> <br> But what if who needs it most is a spoiled diva?<br> <br> Tristan doesn't normally take on movie stars. He doesn't have time for the drama nor their self-centered lifestyle. If they don’t take their own safety seriously, how can he?<br> <br> But there’s something different about Alyse Peterson. On the outside <i>America’s Glamor Princess</i> is everything he wants to avoid. But behind her perfect smile and sapphire eyes is a heartbreak she’s hiding from everyone. <br> <br> She has secrets. And a stalker willing to kill to get to them.<br> <br> <b>His code name is Pisces.</b> <i>And anybody who wants to get to her, will have to go through him.</i><br> <br> •••<br> <i>For your reading pleasure...this version includes both the 1st person POV and 3rd person POV editions—same great story. You choose which version you prefer!</i>\"</p>"; 
